   "unmapped": [
    "The bound depends on a deterministic gap Delta(tau,a) = min_{t>=tau} (lambda_t(a) - lambda_t(a*_tau))/t relative to a consistently best arm in hindsight after round tau. This gap is zero (and the bound vacuous) if no such arm exists."
   ],
   "definition_quote": "An adversarial regime is named by us an adversarial regime with a gap if there exists a round tau and an arm a*_tau that persists to be the best arm in hindsight for all rounds t >= tau. ... Delta(tau,a) = min_{t>=tau} { (1/t)(lambda_t(a) - lambda_t(a*_tau)) }."
  }
